WEBVTT

00:01.720 --> 00:04.060
The girl is only one in the world.

00:04.060 --> 00:06.100
That made her the god of this world.

00:06.690 --> 00:09.760
She found herself on an island when she began to understand things around her.

00:09.760 --> 00:11.690
There was nobody else around.

00:12.240 --> 00:14.450
She had nothing to do.

00:14.450 --> 00:16.990
That was the everything the world offered.

00:17.660 --> 00:20.490
Fly high, make it

00:20.490 --> 00:23.750
Get to the new world that I seek

00:23.960 --> 00:30.340
Someday with my little wings

00:30.500 --> 00:36.510
Don't look back to the sorrow I left behind

00:36.890 --> 00:42.720
Here's my real intention I hide

00:43.270 --> 00:49.480
I wish you were here, and so just right by my side

00:49.690 --> 00:55.780
Need to be strong enough to swallow my pride

00:56.070 --> 01:01.790
I have been looking for my own style

01:01.790 --> 01:09.250
Don't give it up, here comes the life

01:12.170 --> 01:14.920
Be alive, take it

01:14.920 --> 01:18.180
Promise to find, yes I will

01:18.470 --> 01:24.640
Shining wings filled with wishes

01:24.930 --> 01:27.730
Fly high, make it

01:27.730 --> 01:31.190
Get to the new world that I seek

01:31.230 --> 01:37.700
Someday, so I believe

02:00.090 --> 02:02.220
Good afternoon, Chihiro.

02:02.220 --> 02:03.930
Ah, Renji-kun.

02:04.430 --> 02:05.850
How far have you gotten?

02:05.850 --> 02:07.640
I haven't made much progress on it.

02:07.640 --> 02:10.020
About 30 percent of the whole thing.

02:10.020 --> 02:12.690
I can't do it alone after all.

02:12.690 --> 02:14.150
May I take a look?

02:15.360 --> 02:19.240
"One day, the girl tried to light a fire on the beach."

02:19.950 --> 02:26.200
"Because there was an episode in a book about a person who lit a signal fire after being stranded on an island."

02:26.790 --> 02:30.250
"A white line rose up to the deep, blue sky."

02:30.790 --> 02:34.960
"She thought, 'What's this thing that's just like a cloud?' and she put her face near it."

02:34.960 --> 02:37.340
"Her eyes and throat hurt badly."

02:37.840 --> 02:41.550
"She backed off in confusion and gazed at it from a distance."

02:42.470 --> 02:45.260
"She understood that it was useless."

02:45.260 --> 02:48.560
"Likewise, she began to understand one thing after another."

02:48.980 --> 02:51.850
"She understood what 'understanding' meant."

02:53.360 --> 02:54.770
I see.

02:54.770 --> 02:56.020
How is it?

02:56.020 --> 02:59.030
Yeah, this girl is cute.

02:59.030 --> 03:01.530
Cute... eh?

03:02.160 --> 03:04.370
Should I rewrite it after all?

03:04.370 --> 03:05.660
Which part?

03:05.660 --> 03:07.080
Everything up till now.

03:07.330 --> 03:09.410
Wait a minute. Why?

03:09.410 --> 03:12.830
Because you said she was cute.

03:12.830 --> 03:16.800
I don't think she should be described that way.

03:16.800 --> 03:21.340
It's okay. A small episode like this is interesting.

03:21.340 --> 03:23.300
That's wrong, Renji-kun.

03:24.890 --> 03:28.310
This girl should be more abnormal.

03:28.310 --> 03:29.390
Abnormal?

03:29.390 --> 03:33.900
Because the girl is taking things that seem to be a joke seriously,

03:33.900 --> 03:37.650
the reader should get a sense of uneasiness and discomfort.

03:37.650 --> 03:42.400
If she's thought to be cute, it means the girl isn't described properly.

03:43.070 --> 03:44.360
Oh...

03:46.280 --> 03:47.870
My, an obento?

03:48.700 --> 03:50.330
Chihiro-chan's share too?

03:51.080 --> 03:52.750
It doesn't matter, does it?

03:52.750 --> 03:58.840
As a housewife, it helps me that you're good at cooking, but as a mom, my feelings are more complicated.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.590
Why?

04:00.170 --> 04:05.760
Because if you're better than the girl you're dating, you won't be able to receive a love obento from her, will you?

04:06.390 --> 04:07.760
She's not my girlfriend.

04:08.390 --> 04:10.770
You and Chihiro-chan aren't lovers?

04:11.640 --> 04:12.890
We're not.

04:15.350 --> 04:17.860
Geez, you're so timid.

04:17.860 --> 04:20.940
Do I have to be your lover after all?

04:21.280 --> 04:23.950
Th-That's dangerous. That's dangerous, I said.

04:29.910 --> 04:30.870
What's the matter?

04:31.660 --> 04:35.040
N-Nah. I was thinking about my career interests.

04:35.040 --> 04:36.670
Career interests?

04:36.670 --> 04:39.840
A survey of what we want to do in the future.

04:39.840 --> 04:41.300
Really?

04:43.380 --> 04:45.930
I received a career interest survey at school.

04:46.550 --> 04:47.760
Really?

04:47.760 --> 04:51.010
THE STORY OF WESTERN ARCHITECTURE

04:47.760 --> 04:51.010
THE DARK MEDIEVAL TIMES

04:47.760 --> 04:51.010
CHEMINS ET SAVOIRS DU SEL

04:51.010 --> 04:52.140
What's the matter?

04:52.140 --> 04:54.060
Nah, nothing.

04:54.060 --> 04:55.640
What should I do?

04:55.980 --> 04:59.270
I think you should just do what you want to do.

04:59.270 --> 05:02.280
I wouldn't be stressed if I knew what that was.

05:02.280 --> 05:04.360
You don't have any idea at all?

05:04.360 --> 05:06.610
I don't have any special talents.

05:06.610 --> 05:09.280
Your cooking is good.

05:10.450 --> 05:12.290
I'll give it some more thought.

05:17.210 --> 05:18.710
Morning.

05:18.710 --> 05:19.960
Morning.

05:19.960 --> 05:22.670
Hm, good, good.

05:22.670 --> 05:24.800
You're keeping it up.

05:24.800 --> 05:26.340
You mean with the obento?

05:26.340 --> 05:28.970
Yeah. Or should I say with Chihiro-chan?

05:28.970 --> 05:31.350
Well, you could say so.

05:31.350 --> 05:34.930
It's helpful of you to save me the trouble of making breakfast.

05:34.930 --> 05:37.810
Hey, you two still aren't lovers yet?

05:37.810 --> 05:38.940
We're not.

05:38.940 --> 05:39.980
Really?

05:39.980 --> 05:40.860
What?

05:40.860 --> 05:44.650
I just thought that your response hadn't really changed somehow.

05:44.650 --> 05:45.740
You know...

05:46.440 --> 05:49.160
Say, this is just "if."

05:49.160 --> 05:52.780
If Chihiro became my girlfriend, would you be happy?

05:53.830 --> 05:56.290
Hm? If you're happy.

05:57.790 --> 06:00.330
Do you enjoy being with Chihiro-chan?

06:00.330 --> 06:02.460
Th-That...

06:02.880 --> 06:05.760
There's no need to get mad.

06:05.760 --> 06:08.220
I'm not mad.

06:08.760 --> 06:14.100
You're a guy, so you should go out with her with a sense of responsibility.

06:14.100 --> 06:15.180
Responsibility?

06:15.180 --> 06:16.680
Passion is like a downhill slope.

06:16.680 --> 06:19.060
Once you take heart from it, it's unstoppable.

06:19.060 --> 06:21.480
However, love is like an uphill slope.

06:21.480 --> 06:25.530
You have to carry the pains and difficulties while climbing it.

06:27.780 --> 06:32.990
Ah, but the ones who go through difficulties are just couples, while the unstoppable ones are lovers.

06:32.990 --> 06:35.410
Love and passion are exact opposites.

06:35.410 --> 06:39.660
It's something like the inversion of the spelling of "Toufu" and "Nattou."

06:35.410 --> 06:39.660
Toufu, (bean curd) literally means beans that have gone bad, while Nattou, (fermented soybeans) literally means bad beans.

06:39.660 --> 06:41.170
Yes, yes.

06:43.590 --> 06:48.050
"She painted a human being."

06:48.050 --> 06:51.430
"She painted a boy."

06:51.430 --> 06:57.100
"So, she decided to add a figure of a boy into paintings of landscapes she had painted."

06:57.520 --> 07:01.480
"She put up those paintings in the same places where she painted them."

07:01.480 --> 07:04.940
"There was not a single place on the island she did not paint."

07:04.940 --> 07:09.030
"The girl was with the boy everywhere."

07:09.030 --> 07:12.780
"It meant that the girl and the boy looked at each other every time she looked at the paintings."

07:12.780 --> 07:16.950
"But the girl had no feeling of achievement."

07:17.540 --> 07:21.250
"Would it be a 'human'?" she thought.

07:21.250 --> 07:25.170
"No. This was the 'painting of a human being'."

07:25.170 --> 07:28.590
"He did not move. He did not think. He was simply there."

07:29.050 --> 07:30.550
"Lonely?"

07:30.550 --> 07:36.640
"Finally, she could ask herself by finding the word. She was not lonely."

07:38.390 --> 07:39.720
How is it?

07:40.560 --> 07:41.810
I think it's good.

07:41.810 --> 07:44.690
With this, you've made it to about 70 percent, right?

07:44.690 --> 07:47.440
Probably. Isn't it almost over?

07:47.440 --> 07:49.440
Have you decided on the ending?

07:50.150 --> 07:51.490
What should I do?

07:51.940 --> 07:53.150
Wait.

07:54.160 --> 07:56.620
We've come up with two ideas so far.

07:56.950 --> 08:00.120
First, the girl enters the world of the paintings

08:00.120 --> 08:03.750
and leaves behind the paintings of the boy and the girl living a peaceful life.

08:03.750 --> 08:05.170
It's a fantasy-type ending.

08:05.670 --> 08:08.880
Second, the boy appears in her reality.

08:09.300 --> 08:13.260
Even though we haven't decided on the ending yet, it should be a happy ending.

08:13.260 --> 08:19.180
Idea 1

08:13.260 --> 08:19.180
Idea 2

08:13.840 --> 08:19.180
Well, the first idea can turn into a happy ending or a sad ending, depending on your interpretation.

08:19.180 --> 08:20.770
Really?

08:22.060 --> 08:22.980
What's the matter?

08:23.520 --> 08:25.600
Ah, nothing.

08:25.600 --> 08:29.980
You can write the story of her entering the paintings as a fantasy,

08:29.980 --> 08:35.360
but you can also think of it as her escaping from reality in order to run away from loneliness.

08:36.490 --> 08:42.080
You can also think of the girl escaping from reality in order to run away from loneliness.

08:42.370 --> 08:44.870
In other words, she breaks down?

08:46.920 --> 08:49.380
In other words, she breaks down.

08:49.380 --> 08:53.090
Yeah. It depends on the way you put it, but yeah.

08:53.090 --> 08:54.420
I see.

08:54.420 --> 08:56.970
Is this what you've been worrying about this time?

08:56.970 --> 09:00.220
Yes. I think she'll break down.

09:00.220 --> 09:03.730
The girl shouldn't know about loneliness.

09:03.730 --> 09:05.230
Idea 1

09:03.730 --> 09:05.230
Idea 2

09:03.980 --> 09:05.230
I see.

09:05.230 --> 09:10.440
But, if we decide to end the story like this, there's something I don't like about it.

09:10.440 --> 09:11.440
Really?

09:11.440 --> 09:15.240
Doesn't it feel like God is playing with her?

09:18.450 --> 09:20.580
If I try, I can do it after all.

09:20.580 --> 09:22.700
I was surprised myself.

09:22.700 --> 09:26.330
Before I realized it, the story had already gotten much longer. It's fun.

09:26.330 --> 09:28.370
It's all thanks to you.

09:28.370 --> 09:30.460
I didn't do anything.

09:30.460 --> 09:34.760
I feel depressed that I wasn't able to do anything.

09:34.760 --> 09:36.550
Is that so?

09:36.550 --> 09:37.760
Yeah.

09:42.180 --> 09:45.220
Erm, Renji-kun.

09:45.220 --> 09:46.180
What is it?

09:48.940 --> 09:51.690
Nah, it's nothing.

09:55.990 --> 09:59.070
Erm, thank you very much.

09:59.410 --> 10:03.080
Ah, yeah. You're welcome.

10:13.880 --> 10:14.840
Erm...

10:14.840 --> 10:16.090
What is it?

10:16.090 --> 10:20.220
Renji-kun, do you want to... kiss me?

10:21.720 --> 10:24.350
Do you want to kiss me?

10:25.350 --> 10:26.720
You can go ahead.

10:28.310 --> 10:31.480
I don't think I would say that to just anyone.

10:32.480 --> 10:37.240
And it doesn't seem there was anyone else I've been this close to before.

10:38.490 --> 10:45.120
I think I've continued to meet you till now because I trust you.

10:46.120 --> 10:50.250
Besides, it seems you like me too.

10:51.250 --> 10:55.630
That's why you can kiss me as a lover.

10:56.920 --> 11:01.130
I think this is the scene where we should kiss.

11:04.470 --> 11:05.510
Why?

11:06.430 --> 11:08.310
Why am I hesitating?

11:09.310 --> 11:12.650
I... Chihiro...

11:13.100 --> 11:17.780
If she's thought to be cute, it means the girl isn't described properly.

11:18.070 --> 11:21.280
This girl should be more abnormal.

11:21.280 --> 11:22.410
That's not true.

11:23.490 --> 11:26.580
That's not true. It's not like that.

11:27.200 --> 11:28.950
Something is wrong.

11:29.620 --> 11:32.830
But how come Chihiro doesn't look happy?

11:34.380 --> 11:36.170
How come she's not shy about it?

11:37.380 --> 11:39.630
How come her expression doesn't change?

11:40.380 --> 11:45.550
How come she hasn't said a single word about liking me?

11:46.350 --> 11:47.640
How come?

11:48.930 --> 11:52.810
That's because God is playing with you.

11:48.930 --> 11:57.730
is playing with you

11:58.730 --> 12:00.230
It's not like that.

12:00.990 --> 12:02.900
It's not like that.

12:07.780 --> 12:10.200
I'm sorry. I...

12:10.200 --> 12:11.450
It's not like that!

12:13.540 --> 12:15.210
It's not your fault.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.540
Wait, Chihiro!

12:23.340 --> 12:27.180
Please don't write down what happened just now in your diary.

12:28.680 --> 12:31.680
Please don't write it down... no matter what...

12:33.480 --> 12:37.310
Everything... was wrong.

12:39.480 --> 12:41.980
The girl is only one in the world.

12:41.980 --> 12:44.900
That made her the god of this world.

12:55.250 --> 12:56.330
I found it.

12:57.330 --> 12:58.920
I found it.

13:01.420 --> 13:04.130
I thought I didn't need it.

13:09.640 --> 13:11.760
I thought I wouldn't be able to get hold of it.

13:16.520 --> 13:19.770
I gave up. But we met.

13:23.030 --> 13:25.820
That's my whereabouts.

13:23.030 --> 13:26.280
That's ——

13:23.030 --> 13:26.280
my whereabouts

13:26.280 --> 13:29.780
Ah, I wonder if this is a bit too daring.

13:29.780 --> 13:32.660
It might be too stimulating for Hirono-kun.

13:34.160 --> 13:35.660
I'm leaving.

13:41.170 --> 13:42.420
Just kidding.

13:46.170 --> 13:49.180
Papa. Mama.

13:50.260 --> 13:53.010
Ah, the preparations for tomorrow.

13:54.930 --> 13:56.430
This will work.

14:08.700 --> 14:11.450
This is a place where sound has vanished.

14:11.450 --> 14:17.200
One day, Mom vanished from Dad's heart, and Dad also vanished from Mom's heart.

14:22.750 --> 14:24.210
Ah, Mama?

14:26.960 --> 14:27.760
Ah?

14:29.970 --> 14:31.640
What's wrong, Ma...

14:40.980 --> 14:44.690
After that, sound vanished from this house.

14:45.320 --> 14:48.440
After that, conversation vanished.

14:49.320 --> 14:53.280
All color vanished from my world.

14:54.990 --> 14:59.500
Mom

14:54.990 --> 14:59.580
Dad

14:54.990 --> 15:04.000
Miyako

14:55.740 --> 15:01.370
Before I knew it, even I vanished from their hearts.

15:02.630 --> 15:04.000
Ever since then,

15:04.710 --> 15:07.630
I've been living in a world with nothing.

15:26.610 --> 15:30.110
At last, I've found a world with sound.

15:30.110 --> 15:32.150
I've found a home with color.

15:32.610 --> 15:35.530
I don't need to shut myself in anymore.

15:37.280 --> 15:40.450
I can't answer your call right now.

15:40.450 --> 15:44.250
Please say your name and what I can do for you after the "beep".

15:45.000 --> 15:48.210
Yahoo! Hirono-kun, this is Miyako.

15:48.210 --> 15:49.840
Have you woken up yet?

15:49.840 --> 15:54.760
I'm about to leave home. I'll get to our meeting place at noon, so don't be late.

15:54.760 --> 15:55.800
Bye then.

16:01.810 --> 16:04.690
Oh, what a heroic battle royal.

16:04.690 --> 16:07.110
The rule of wild nature is harsh.

16:10.570 --> 16:12.820
Oh, it's time.

16:14.570 --> 16:20.040
Yahoo! Hirono-kun, I'm already here. Are you on your way?

16:20.040 --> 16:22.330
I won't forgive you if you're late.

16:28.920 --> 16:30.880
Hey, you're late.

16:30.880 --> 16:33.470
You should arrive ten minutes early when you go on a date.

16:33.470 --> 16:36.840
It's a guy's obligation not to make the girl wait.

16:38.550 --> 16:40.680
You're late. You're late, late, late!

16:40.680 --> 16:42.560
How long are you going to make me wait?

16:42.560 --> 16:45.980
As punishment, everything is your treat today.

16:45.980 --> 16:48.400
Okay. Hurry up and run here.

16:50.020 --> 16:53.610
What's wrong? Don't tell me you're sleeping?

16:53.610 --> 16:56.320
If you overslept, I won't just let it go.

16:58.120 --> 17:03.200
Hi-ro-no-kun! This is Miyako.

17:03.200 --> 17:06.960
You're still not coming? I'm waiting!

17:09.040 --> 17:11.210
Geez, what are you thinking?

17:11.210 --> 17:13.210
How many hours do you want me to wait?

17:13.210 --> 17:15.130
Are you really planning on coming?

17:23.390 --> 17:24.890
Miyako

17:23.390 --> 17:24.890
ERASE HISTORY?

17:23.390 --> 17:24.890
YES

17:23.390 --> 17:24.890
NO

17:23.390 --> 17:24.890
Miyako

17:25.890 --> 17:30.400
ERASE?

17:26.270 --> 17:30.400
I will wipe you out from Onii-chan's heart.

17:31.400 --> 17:35.820
ERASE?

17:31.770 --> 17:33.820
He will then say farewell to you.

17:33.820 --> 17:35.820
And then, it will be over.

17:36.780 --> 17:38.410
ERASE?

17:37.200 --> 17:38.410
I will end this.

17:42.200 --> 17:44.040
I'm going to disappear again?

17:46.460 --> 17:48.420
Hello, Hirono-kun?

17:48.420 --> 17:52.340
Have you possibly mistaken our meeting place?

17:52.340 --> 17:56.010
It's the bench in front of the fountain. You should know, right?

17:56.010 --> 17:59.220
If you're lost, call me. I'll come and pick you up.

18:00.800 --> 18:04.060
This is Miyako. Are you all right, Hirono-kun?

18:04.060 --> 18:07.140
You didn't have an accident on your way over, did you?

18:07.140 --> 18:09.600
Contact me right away after you hear this.

18:11.310 --> 18:14.190
Enough of this! At least contact me!

18:14.190 --> 18:15.940
You can at least give me a call!

18:15.940 --> 18:18.150
I'm worried about you!

18:19.570 --> 18:23.240
This is Miyako. Hirono-kun? Pick up the phone.

18:23.240 --> 18:24.870
You're there, right?

18:25.240 --> 18:28.120
You're actually listening to this, right?

18:28.120 --> 18:30.750
Pick up the phone. Let's have a talk.

18:30.750 --> 18:32.630
Talk to me.

18:33.840 --> 18:35.340
Why don't you come?

18:35.340 --> 18:37.010
Why don't you pick up the phone?

18:37.010 --> 18:38.590
Why don't you answer my call?

18:38.590 --> 18:39.430
Why?

18:39.430 --> 18:40.840
Why are you silent?

18:40.840 --> 18:41.800
Why?

18:44.140 --> 18:47.310
Hirono-kun? Please contact me.

18:47.310 --> 18:50.640
I'm not really mad or anything. I'll wait till we meet.

18:50.640 --> 18:53.270
I'll keep waiting till I hear your voice!

18:54.900 --> 18:57.480
Please, I beg you......

18:57.480 --> 18:58.780
Come and see me.

18:59.360 --> 19:02.160
I just need to see your face.

19:02.160 --> 19:05.240
I just need to hear your voice.

19:05.240 --> 19:06.370
Please......!

19:08.370 --> 19:11.750
Hirono-kun, you will come, right......?

19:11.750 --> 19:15.000
I...... should keep waiting, right......?

19:15.000 --> 19:18.630
I believe you...... I believe you......

19:20.590 --> 19:23.550
Please...... answer me......

19:23.550 --> 19:27.260
You can answer me by mail too...... Even a single word is fine......

19:27.260 --> 19:29.980
Please...... don't leave me alone......

19:29.980 --> 19:33.520
I will wait for you...... I will keep waiting for you......!

19:35.940 --> 19:39.280
Why...... Why......?

19:39.280 --> 19:43.660
Even though you promised me...... Even though I believed you......

19:43.660 --> 19:45.200
Why.....?

19:46.530 --> 19:48.330
Am I no good......?

19:48.330 --> 19:52.080
Am I no good perhaps......?

19:52.080 --> 19:55.630
Do you hate me......?

19:55.630 --> 19:59.170
If that's the case, please tell me so......!

19:59.170 --> 20:01.970
If you hate me, just say it!

20:01.970 --> 20:05.970
Don't just stay silent! Say something! I beg you!

20:05.970 --> 20:08.680
I beg you, please say something!

20:10.810 --> 20:16.060
......I'm sorry...... I'm sorry that I said something weird......

20:16.060 --> 20:19.150
Are you mad......? You're mad, right......?

20:19.150 --> 20:27.200
I always have things my own way...... say things as I like...... abuse you......

20:27.200 --> 20:30.700
I'm sorry...... I'm sorry......!

20:32.120 --> 20:35.620
I didn't manage to fall asleep.

20:35.620 --> 20:38.130
I was looking forward to today's date.

20:38.130 --> 20:42.210
When I thought about you, my heart kept pounding......

20:43.170 --> 20:46.090
This is my first time having this feeling......

20:46.090 --> 20:49.010
I didn't know what to do.......

20:49.010 --> 20:53.270
I want to see you...... I want to see you......

20:56.350 --> 20:58.980
Help me, Hirono-kun......

20:58.980 --> 21:01.190
Help me......!

21:01.190 --> 21:04.360
I don't want to disappear...... I don't want to disappear......!

21:04.360 --> 21:10.160
I don't want to disappear from your heart!!

21:43.070 --> 21:50.660
kawaranai mainichi megurimeguru

21:43.070 --> 21:50.660
The unchanging days keep repeating

21:52.700 --> 21:59.370
nani mo nai jikan ga sugiru

21:52.700 --> 21:59.370
Empty time passes

22:02.340 --> 22:09.970
kaze ni yurameite arukidaseba

22:02.340 --> 22:09.970
If I start walking waveringly in the wind

22:11.890 --> 22:20.400
itsuka kawaru kana ashita

22:11.890 --> 22:20.400
I wonder if it will change sometime tomorrow

22:23.150 --> 22:32.780
nakushita mono wo sagashite wa akiramete

22:23.150 --> 22:32.780
I give up searching for what I lost

22:32.950 --> 22:44.920
hitori tatazumi sora wo miteita

22:32.950 --> 22:44.920
Standing still alone and looking up at the sky

22:48.340 --> 22:49.550
Can you walk?

22:49.550 --> 22:53.260
I'm all right. It's really not a big deal.

22:53.260 --> 22:55.680
I'm going to the convenience store. Do you want something?

22:55.680 --> 22:56.810
Garibori-kun.

22:56.810 --> 22:58.270
I meant dinner.

22:58.270 --> 22:59.600
Should I make it?

22:59.600 --> 23:00.940
Don't frighten me.

23:00.940 --> 23:05.520
That's mean! I've been practicing my cooking recently.

23:05.520 --> 23:08.400
Ask me again when you don't need to practice anymore.

23:08.400 --> 23:09.610
Can I just buy what I see fit?

23:09.610 --> 23:11.070
Yeah, I'll leave it to you.

23:14.620 --> 23:17.120
What? Isn't it right here...

23:17.120 --> 23:20.120
Incoming Mail History

23:17.120 --> 23:20.120
Miyako

23:25.710 --> 23:27.380
Deleted.

23:28.170 --> 23:31.800
Colorless colors are pure and cold.

23:32.550 --> 23:37.310
Next episode, ef - a tale of memories: clear colour.

23:38.100 --> 23:40.680
Do you have memories you don't want to forget?
